<article class="ltx_document">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Expert Threshold Routing for Autoregressive Language Modeling with Dynamic Computation Allocation and Load Balancing</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Ryan Sun
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
